  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The proposed single storey rear extension, by reason of its excessive rearward projection, results in an unacceptable sense of enclosure due to the adjacent habitable room at no: 103&amp;nbsp;Drury Road being hemmed by both neighbouring properties at nos: 101 and 103&amp;nbsp;Drury Road resulting in&amp;nbsp; overshadowing and loss of sunlight, daylight and outlook, to the detriment of the visual and residential amenities of the occupiers No 103 Drury Road, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3.D 7 of The London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of The Harrow Local Plan 2021-2044 and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
